    <string name="battery_title">Keep counting in the background</string>
    <string name="battery_detail">OnePlus and other phones stop apps to save battery, which turns counting off. Allow Reel Counter to run in the background. On OnePlus, also open Recent apps, tap Reel Counter\'s ⋮ menu and choose Lock.</string>
