    <string name="island_title">Your reel island</string>
    <string name="island_detail">Floats at the top of the screen while you use a supported app. After each reel it shows today\'s reel count, then your total time in that app today, which resets at midnight. Iris glides from happy to angry as your count nears the limit, gets electrocuted when you scroll fast and dozes off after 3 minutes without a reel, pleads when you skip the pause screen and turns sad after the anger at your limit. Drag her to move her; tap her to poke her.</string>
